{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"We need count of satisfying assignments for CNF with 12 variables. Clauses list. Let's enumerate? 12 variables, 12 clauses. Could use brute force? 2^12=4096 manageable. But we need to use tools? We can use enumerate tool. Let's use enumerate.We can call enumerate with no args.{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"name\":\"enumerate\",\"args\":{}}We need to parse output.We don't have output yet. Let's assume enumerate returns count? But we need to produce final answer. Let's manually compute? Might be easier to use reasoning. Let's attempt to analyze constraints.\n\nVariables: 1..12.\n\nClauses:\n\n1. [-11,12] => (¬x11 ∨ x12)\n2. [-2,6] => (¬x2 ∨ x6)\n3. [2,5] => (x2 ∨ x5)\n4. [-3,8] => (¬x3 ∨ x8)\n5. [-10,8] => (¬x10 ∨ x8)\n6. [-4,7] => (¬x4 ∨ x7)\n7. [-1,7] => (¬x1 ∨ x7)\n8. [-5,6] => (¬x5 ∨ x6)\n9. [-9,12] => (¬x9 ∨ x12)\n10. [11,9] => (x11 ∨ x9)\n11. [3,10] => (x3 ∨ x10)\n12. [4,1] => (x4 ∨ x1)\n\nWe need count of assignments satisfying all.\n\nLet's analyze pairwise.\n\nClause 1: either x11=0 or x12=1.\n\nClause 10: x11=1 or x9=1.\n\nClause 9: x9=0 or x12=1.\n\nSo combine: If x12=0 then from 1 need x11=0. From 9 need x9=0. From 10 need x11=1 or x9=1. But both 0 -> unsat. So x12 cannot be 0. Therefore x12=1. Then clause1 satisfied regardless of x11. Clause9 satisfied regardless of x9. Clause10 requires x11=1 or x9=1. So at least one of x11,x9 must be 1.\n\nThus we have x12=1 fixed. Variables remaining 1-11.\n\nNow consider clauses involving 2,5,6:\n\nClause2: ¬x2 ∨ x6 => if x2=1 then x6=1.\n\nClause3: x2 ∨ x5 => at least one of x2,x5 is 1.\n\nClause8: ¬x5 ∨ x6 => if x5=1 then x6=1.\n\nThus if either x2 or x5 is 1, then x6 must be 1. So x6=1 unless both x2=0 and x5=0. But clause3 requires at least one of x2,x5=1. So impossible to have both 0. Therefore at least one of x2,x5=1, hence x6=1. So x6=1 forced.\n\nThus x6=1.\n\nNow clauses 4,5,11 involving 3,8,10:\n\nClause4: ¬x3 ∨ x8 => if x3=1 then x8=1.\n\n"}}],"created":1790959541,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4195,"total_tokens":4963,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-lhX0ONnycTZ9rc1Hgc0zdMl3AXTJdAoF","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4195,"prompt_ms":531.976,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.1268119189511323,"prompt_per_second":7885.694091462772,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2471.367,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.2221212516297264,"predicted_per_second":310.35455276371334}}